{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/18720","id":2301074691,"node_id":"PR_kwDOACG9q86JJ50D","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18720","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18720.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18720.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18720","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/18720/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/18720/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18720/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/statuses/15152b64586f2b30012d5b99906a2777c4793c41","number":18720,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"KAFKA-18654 [1/2]: Transaction Version 2 performance regression due to early return","user":{"login":"jolshan","id":25566826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NTY2ODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25566826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan","html_url":"https://github.com/jolshan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jolshan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18575 solved a critical race condition by returning with CONCURRENT_TRANSACTIONS early when the transaction was still completing. \r\nIn testing, it was discovered that this early return could cause performance regressions.\r\n\r\nPrior to KIP-890 the addpartitions call was a separate call from the producer. There was a previous change https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-5477 that decreased the retry backoff. With KIP-890 and making the call through the produce path, we go back to the default retry backoff which takes longer. Prior to 18575 we introduce a slight delay when sending to the coordinator, so prior to 18575, we are less likely to return quickly and get stuck in this backoff. However, based on results from produce benchmarks, we can still run into 100ms backoff in some scenarios. \r\n\r\nThis PR reverts KAFKA-18575, and doesn't return early and wait until the coordinator for checking if a transaction is ongoing. Instead, it will fix the handling with the verification guard so we don't hit the edge condition. \r\n\r\nAlso cleans up some of the verification text that was unclear.\r\n","labels":[{"id":838330122,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core","name":"core","description":"Kafka Broker","color":"ed5a86","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5610263660,"node_id":"LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABTmXUbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/storage","name":"storage","description":"Pull requests that target the storage module","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-28T00:05:38Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T23:24:34Z","closed_at":"2025-02-03T23:24:34Z","merged_at":"2025-02-03T23:24:34Z","merge_commit_sha":"ab8ef87c7f920894566c25234e9ed2d8f1f9cce2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jolshan:kafka-18654","ref":"kafka-18654","repo":{"id":289319790,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyODkzMTk3O